{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2e5d6055ea2992b68e244ade1de4d6c0c716181d7a15433dd2ae9a02334c85bb", "ja": "{$P$}Pさん、\nまだ帰ってきてないんだ……。", "zh": "{$P$}P先生\n还没回来吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "da970579c0d72fd7a8da41e0476e0bdf1278eda5144f872fcf9d5c99f237b389", "ja": "いつも忙しそう。\n今日のスケジュールだと、もう\n戻ってくる頃なのに……。", "zh": "感觉他总是很忙呢。\n以今天的行程来看，\n差不多该回来了说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "544692da5d8d11d53a207f91bd12f3c31eed0e389dcec6a6820b8bb74a497932", "ja": "社長さんのことだから、また\n{$P$}Pさんに\n大事なお仕事を任せるのかも…。", "zh": "毕竟是社长要找他，\n可能又要把重要的工作交给\n{$P$}P先生了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "1b887995a90dc81ad3a8c4cb3efd3da1b4eb0928f74326f3f11d5d9800b6338d", "ja": "よ～し！　私も、せいいっぱい\nお手伝いしなきゃ！", "zh": "好～！我也得尽全力\n好好帮忙才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
